# Hogaak, Arisen Necropolis: convoke pays each generic mana with any creature, but a colored mana only with a creature
# of that color (CR 702.51a), and its two {B/G} are hybrid, so each needs a black or green creature. On turn 5 Bot1 has
# seven creatures, Llanowar Elves and six colorless Ornithopters: enough bodies, but only one of them is black or green,
# so the cast is not offered. On turn 7 a Birds of Paradise gives the second green creature and Hogaak is cast, tapping
# the Elves, the Birds and five Ornithopters (the positive control; the sixth Ornithopter stays untapped).

